    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keith McLoughlin of Sheehy Meares Auctioneers is delighted to present this charming mid-terrace townhouse to the market, ideally situated in the heart of Frenchpark Village, Co. Roscommon.\nExtending to approximately 114 sq. m., this spacious home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, with an abundance of natural light enhancing its welcoming atmosphere.\nThe ground floor comprises a bright entrance hallway, a dining room featuring a traditional Stanley stove, timber flooring and timber ceiling, a comfortable sitting room with an open fireplace, a living room, kitchen, and a family bathroom.\nUpstairs, the property offers four generously sized bedrooms, a family bathroom, and an additional storage room suitable for a variety of uses, including a home office, walk-in wardrobe, or hobby room.\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, outbuildings to the rear, and a concrete yard providing useful outdoor space.\nIdeally positioned within walking distance of all amenities in Frenchpark Village, including shops, the national school, church, GAA facilities, and a range of local services, this property offers the perfect blend of convenience and community living.\nFrenchpark is located just 10 minutes from both Castlerea and Ballaghaderreen, while Roscommon Town is less than 30 minutes away, offering excellent accessibility via the N5 and N61 road networks. Ireland West Airport Knock is approximately 25 minutes away, providing convenient national and international travel connections. Families will appreciate the availability of nearby secondary schools in Castlerea and Ballaghaderreen, with daily bus services operating from the village.\nThe surrounding area is renowned for its natural beauty and rich heritage, with scenic walking trails, Lough Gara, and the Rathcroghan Heritage Visitor Centre all within easy reach as well as access to Shannon-Erne waterway at Carrick on Shannon just over 20 minutes away..\nThis property presents an excellent opportunity for owner-occupiers, investors, or those seeking a spacious home in a thriving village setting with excellent regional connectivity.\nViewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Spacious 4-bedroom mid-terrace townhouse extending to approximately 114 sq. m. \n\n• Bright and well-proportioned accommodation with excellent natural light throughout\n\n• Dining room with Stanley stove and sitting room with open fireplace\n\n• Oil-fired central heating, rear outbuildings and concrete yard\n\n• Prime village-centre location within walking distance of shops, school, church and local amenities\n\n• Conveniently located just 10 minutes from Castlerea and Ballaghaderreen, less than 30 minutes from Roscommon Town and 25 minutes from Ireland West Airport Knock\n\n"
